/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 310 0 R
/E (Renaissance Academy Charter School of the Arts will improve the quality of education for the children in our community. Through thematic, arts integrated curricula, our students will become critical thinkers, make connections, and solve real world problems as literate citizens. Students will embody grit, self-control, zest, friendship, gratitude, optimism, and curiosity.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
