373 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 311 0 R
/E (     As we close the chapter on our eleventh year serving the children of Rochester, I am filled with both gratitude and resolve. Renaissance Academy Charter School of the Arts was founded on a powerful belief: every child, regardless of background, deserves opportunity, belonging, and the tools to thrive. Over the past year, that belief has continued to guide every decision, every classroom innovation, and every conversation with our families.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
374 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 311 0 R
/E (     This year, we served over 500 students, the majority of whom come from economically disadvantaged households. In a city where 42% of children live in poverty, we continue to be more than a school, we are a place of stability, creativity, and hope. From our inclusive arts-integrated curriculum to our specialized classrooms for students with unique learning needs, we have remained steadfast in our mission to meet every child where they are and to ensure they grow in both confidence and capability.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
375 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 311 0 R
/E (     We are especially proud of our self-contained 15:1:1 special education classrooms, and our integrated co-teaching model at every grade level that allows students of all abilities to learn and thrive together. These classrooms are unique among charter schools in Rochester and are more than just academic spaces; they are daily expressions of our values.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
376 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 311 0 R
/E (     Of course, none of this is possible without you. Our dedicated teachers, staff, families, partners, and supporters make up the vibrant community that lifts our students higher every day. Your belief in our mission enables us to support families through crisis, provide rich artistic experiences, and prepare our students not just for the next grade, but for life.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
377 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 311 0 R
/E (     As we look ahead, our vision continues to grow. We aim to deepen our community partnerships, expand services for students and families, and welcome even more people into the Renaissance Academy story. Thank you for standing with us. Together, we are shaping a future where every child is seen, valued, and empowered to succeed.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
