504 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 316 0 R
/E (RA primarily serves economically disadvantaged students from the city of Rochester, where 42% of children live in poverty. Our students and their families often face systemic challenges, housing and food insecurity, limited access to health care and mental health services, community violence, and a lack of equitable resources. Currently, 1 in 10 students at RA are experiencing homelessness. We know that when families struggle, students cannot fully show up ready to learn.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
