/E (Because charter schools like RA do not receive the same level of public funding and receive no support for facilities, we rely on local contributions to fill critical gaps. Each year, we must seek additional funding to sustain essential programs such as teacher professional development, social-emotional and family support services, summer learning opportunities, and before-school programming, resources that would otherwise be supported by full and equitable state funding our students deserve.)
