/E (As of July 2025, federal Title II, III, and IV education funds were frozen, forcing Renaissance Academy and many other schools into immediate financial deficits, despite having already budgeted and expended these funds for the current fiscal year. Although the federal government released the withheld funds on July 25, the uncertainty and disruption caused by the abrupt pause created turmoil for school leaders trying to finalize staffing, programming, and support services. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [8]
>>
